  11: 
  12:     Input structure
  13:     - The input is a square grid treated as one complete sprite.
  14: 
  15:     Rule
  16:     - Each output quadrant is a 2x2 repetition of a rotated copy of the whole input.
  17:     - The quadrant rotations are upper-left 180 degrees, upper-right 90 degrees
  18:       clockwise, lower-left 90 degrees counterclockwise, and lower-right unchanged.
  19: 
  20:     Key insight
  21:     - The output is a 4x4 grid of original-size blocks, not a per-pixel scale-up.
