  27:     Dock train sprites onto station groups by matching coupler count, then orient via divider-color markers.
  28: 
  29:     Input structure:
  30:     - bg; colored stripes (edge + internal) partition grid into rectangular regions.
  31:     - Color 8 forms train bodies; color 9 marks both isolated stations and train-attached couplers.
  32:     - Stripe-colored pixels on trains are orientation markers.
